      "writtenOn": "2023-09-27T15:03:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The idea here is to cover especially such scenario:\n\nPending Unicast failure\n- Unicast is getting active (mActiveState \u003d\u003d ACTIVE_STATE_PENDING_ACTIVE)\n- In meantime (before getting LeAudioStackEvent.GROUP_STATUS_INACTIVE or LeAudioStackEvent.GROUP_STATUS_ACTIVE a broadcast start request come\n- Broadcast is added to Queue\n- LeAudioStackEvent.GROUP_STATUS_INACTIVE comes because of some failure in stack\n- There is no sense to handleGroupTransitToInactive cause group wasn\u0027t previously activated\n- Check if there is queued broadcast and try to create it\n\nCould you point me what race could it be here, maybe I\u0027m not getting it - sorry ?\n\nps. thank you for pointing out to this - I\u0027ve forgot to set here group to INACTIVE.",
